{"id":"coartada","lemma":"coartada","pos":"noun","rank":2206,"glosses":["alibi","excuse, alibi, cover"],"ipa":"/koaɾˈtada/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"coartadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-coartada.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Tienes una coartada?","en":"Do you have an alibi?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/83553","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Él tenía una fuerte coartada.","en":"He had a strong alibi.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"strong"},null]},{"text":"Todos los cuatro muchachos no tenían coartadas.","en":"All four of the boys didn't have alibis.","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"a four-stringed guitar…"},{"g":"boy or young adult","l":"muchacho"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null]},{"text":"Ninguno de los cuatro chicos tenía coartada.","en":"None of the four boys had an alibi.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608969","words":[{"g":"nobody"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"a four-stringed guitar…"},{"g":"boy","l":"chico"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null]},{"text":"No tienes una coartada para el día del homicidio.","en":"You don't have an alibi for the day of the murder.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"day"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"homicide"}]}]}